  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of the **Georgia Department of Revenue \u2013 Motor Vehicle Division (MVD) Tag Renewal Portal** at **mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx**:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Georgia MVD \u2013 Tag Renewal Portal\n\nThis is the **official online tag (vehicle registration) renewal website** for the State of Georgia, operated by the **Georgia Department of Revenue (DOR)**.\n\n### What You Can Do on This Site:\n\nGeorgia MVD offers online applications and information regarding **tag renewals, license plates, titles, dealer registrations, and commercial vehicles**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd11 Renewing Your Tag Online\n\nTo renew online, you'll need your **Renewal Identification Number (RIN)**:\n\n- A RIN is a **12-digit number** necessary for online renewals.\n- To obtain your RIN online, visit the portal and select **\"Obtain/Retrieve a RIN,\"** then enter your plate number, name, and address.\n\n---\n\n### \u26a0\ufe0f Important Reminders\n\n- If the address on your Renewal Notice is **not correct**, do **not** renew online. You must also present your **driver's license or Georgia ID** to renew.\n\n- After vehicle registration, you will receive a **license plate with a decal**, which must be **renewed each year**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f License Plates\n\n- Georgia offers **hundreds of specialty plate designs** to choose from, including veterans, colleges, special interest groups, and more.\n- A new standard-issue license plate is available to commemorate the **250th anniversary of the Revolutionary War**, featuring a design created by a Georgia Middle School student.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde Contact & Verification\n\n- The telephone number for MVD is **(855) 406-5221**.\n- Call **1-800-GEORGIA** to verify that a website is an official website of the State of Georgia.\n\n---\n\n> \ud83d\udd17 **Direct Link:** [mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx](https://mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx)\n\nIs there something specific you'd like help with regarding your Georgia vehicle registration or tag renewal?",
